  "description": "SDK for ECM Client & Server development using OPC UA. The OPC UA Energy Consumption Management (ECM) Companion Specification defines a standardized information model for monitoring and managing the energy consumption of machines and equipment. It enables seamless integration of energy-related data into OPC UA environments, allowing for consistent representation of consumption values, power measurements, and energy-relevant process parameters. This facilitates interoperability between equipment, control systems, and enterprise applications, supporting advanced energy monitoring, consumption optimization, and efficient data exchange across industrial environments.",
